### Phase 7 - interest messages
@host = http://localhost:8080
@userA = paste-owner-token
@userB = paste-buyer-token
@postId = 1
@interestId = 1

### 1. User A creates a post, then User B sends interest -> 201
POST {{host}}/api/posts/{{postId}}/interest
Authorization: Bearer {{userB}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "message": "Is this still available? I can pick it up today.",
  "contactInfo": "9876543210"
}

### 2. User B tries again -> 409
POST {{host}}/api/posts/{{postId}}/interest
Authorization: Bearer {{userB}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "message": "Sending a second message.",
  "contactInfo": "9876543210"
}

### 3. User B messages their own post -> 400
POST {{host}}/api/posts/{{postId}}/interest
Authorization: Bearer {{userA}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "message": "Talking to myself.",
  "contactInfo": "9876543210"
}

### 4. User A sees it in received -> 200
GET {{host}}/api/interests/received?unreadOnly=false&page=0&size=20
Authorization: Bearer {{userA}}

### 5. User A's unread badge -> 200, count >= 1
GET {{host}}/api/interests/unread-count
Authorization: Bearer {{userA}}

### 6. User B sees it in sent -> 200
GET {{host}}/api/interests/sent?page=0&size=20
Authorization: Bearer {{userB}}

### 7. User B must not mark it read -> 404
PATCH {{host}}/api/interests/{{interestId}}/read
Authorization: Bearer {{userB}}

### 8. User A marks it read -> 200
PATCH {{host}}/api/interests/{{interestId}}/read
Authorization: Bearer {{userA}}

### 9. Mark read again -> 200 (idempotent)
PATCH {{host}}/api/interests/{{interestId}}/read
Authorization: Bearer {{userA}}

### 10. Unread count drops -> 0 for that message
GET {{host}}/api/interests/unread-count
Authorization: Bearer {{userA}}

### 11. Post detail as User B now shows interested=true
GET {{host}}/api/posts/{{postId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{userB}}

### 12. Validation: short message -> 400
POST {{host}}/api/posts/{{postId}}/interest
Authorization: Bearer {{userB}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"message": "hi", "contactInfo": "9876543210"}

### 13. Validation: missing contactInfo -> 400
POST {{host}}/api/posts/{{postId}}/interest
Authorization: Bearer {{userB}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"message": "Is this still available?"}

### 14. Invalid post / other college / expired -> 404
POST {{host}}/api/posts/999999/interest
Authorization: Bearer {{userB}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"message": "Is this still available?", "contactInfo": "9876543210"}